"""Prerequisite edges for selective-required topics. Each edge points from a dependent topic to its prerequisite.

Include only prerequisites that are used: topics within the selective-required volumes and existing topics from required high school, junior high, and elementary school.
Transitive reduction runs at build time and only removes edges among newly added topics.
"""
